    "causal_summary": "Notion two-way relations store a second property on the target data source and mirror it on write: the relation type object is `{ datasourceid, dualproperty: { syncedpropertyid, syncedpropertyname } }` (Notion API, `developers.notion.com/reference/property-object#relation`), and \"with two-way relations, the edits work both ways\" (`notion.com/help/relations-and-rollups`)",
